      "content": "hey, im working on the draft for the city council's weekly newsletter. i gotta put in a section about the upcoming vote on the new congestion pricing zone in the downtown core. \n\nhere are the main points i need to cover:\n- vote is happening next tuesday\n- the plan involves a fee for driving into the central business district during peak hours\n- goal is to reduce traffic congestion and lower carbon emissions\n- some local business owners and commuters are worried about the extra cost and how it'll affect people coming in from outside the city\n\ncan u help me write this up so it sounds professional and interesting for the residents? thanks!",
